    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lost in the Mirrors</h2><strong>A Horror Cleaning Simulation Trapped in a Mirror Maze</strong><br>You are a cleaner trapped in a mysterious maze, tasked with cleaning mirrors while searching for an escape. Can you survive this bizarre world?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Intense Cleaning Experience: Polish the tainted mirrors to a shine. But beware, your reflection may not be the only thing you see.<br>Maze Exploration: Navigate a bewildering labyrinth where mirrors and passages are indistinguishable. Every turn might conceal a new horror.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2>30-60 minutes<br><br>Grab your cleaning tools and dive into the distorted reality of &quot;Lost in the Mirrors&quot;. Can you clean all the mirrors and escape unscathed?",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lost in the Mirrors</h2><strong>A Horror Cleaning Simulation Trapped in a Mirror Maze</strong><br>You are a cleaner trapped in a mysterious maze, tasked with cleaning mirrors while searching for an escape. Can you survive this bizarre world?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Intense Cleaning Experience: Polish the tainted mirrors to a shine. But beware, your reflection may not be the only thing you see.<br>Maze Exploration: Navigate a bewildering labyrinth where mirrors and passages are indistinguishable. Every turn might conceal a new horror.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2>30-60 minutes<br><br>Grab your cleaning tools and dive into the distorted reality of &quot;Lost in the Mirrors&quot;. Can you clean all the mirrors and escape unscathed?",
